HIstory and vsersions of htl

Html - Invented by Tim Berners Lee- 1991  at CERN.( European reserach)
1991- Basic text and links
1995- Forms and table
1997- javascript(Functionalities) and css(styling), iframes, more tags

1999- Multimedia support and interactivity
XHTML 1.02000HTML reformulated using XML rules
2014- HTML5-Semantic elements, multimedia tags, form- email,phone, apis,local storage,
